WEBVTT

00:00:56.992 --> 00:01:01.229
And after an hour or so
of furious exertion,

00:01:01.253 --> 00:01:02.903
I can honestly tell you

00:01:02.927 --> 00:01:05.840
that not knowing who has won

00:01:05.864 --> 00:01:08.689
feels like the ultimate victory.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.714
In Japan, it's been said,

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:16.317
they've created a competitive spirit
without competition.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:24.512
Now, all of you know that geopolitics
is best followed by watching ping-pong.

00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:26.778
(Laughter)

00:01:26.802 --> 00:01:31.683
The two strongest powers in the world
were fiercest enemies